Subject: [PATCH 063/159] [ae-patch] Show the model each agent ran on in the
 Agents pane's Model column.

Child session rows gain a model field: the model the harness reported for
the child, else the model its own usage was recorded against (Codex
collaborators report it there), else the requested override. The
claude-native forwarder now reports each Claude Code subagent's
message.model to its mirrored child through external_model_change, once
per change, so new subagents fill in too. The pane prints Claude ids as
names ("Sonnet 5.5") and moves the status dot from the empty space
before Model to the right of Time.
